    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circadial is a psychological horror game about what occurs when nightmares become one with reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENTER THE EXPERIMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Jesse Coleman, a 32 year old man who has been plagued by terrible night terrors since he was a child. You have been an insomniac your whole life. However, there may be a cure for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been chosen to take part in a case study for the newly created Circadial pills, a drug meant to counteract sleep disorders. You only need to make it through three trials to test the effects of the pills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298620/extras/2070f934770682d3cf57d2edc6613827.avif?t=1752192275\" data-has-big width=800 height=604 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fall asleep at the end of each trial you will encounter new dreams, each more distorted and abnormal than the last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore their nightmarish landscapes to recover memories of your past and locate the real source of your torment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298620/extras/3b4dfdd5eec43a079778618e2411674d.avif?t=1752192275\" data-has-big width=800 height=602 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He waits for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man who stands behind closet doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Circadial is a psychological horror game about what occurs when nightmares become one with reality.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>ENTER THE EXPERIMENT</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You play as Jesse Coleman, a 32 year old man who has been plagued by terrible night terrors since he was a child. You have been an insomniac your whole life. However, there may be a cure for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been chosen to take part in a case study for the newly created Circadial pills, a drug meant to counteract sleep disorders. You only need to make it through three trials to test the effects of the pills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298620/extras/2070f934770682d3cf57d2edc6613827.avif?t=1752192275\" data-has-big width=800 height=604 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FACE YOUR FEARS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you fall asleep at the end of each trial you will encounter new dreams, each more distorted and abnormal than the last. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore their nightmarish landscapes to recover memories of your past and locate the real source of your torment.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3298620/extras/3b4dfdd5eec43a079778618e2411674d.avif?t=1752192275\" data-has-big width=800 height=602 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He waits for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The man who stands behind closet doors.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "You've been invited to participate in a study for the newly developed Circadial pills, a medicine designed to remedy your life-long insomnia. Explore the empty halls of the facility and the landscapes of your dreams to uncover the source of your night terrors. You will never be the same.",
